; ResCCOM 1.3-a — authoritative zone for .island (CLAUDE.md: services
; subnet 10.46.0.0/24, local-only DNS zone, never routed between islands).
; Addresses reserved now so DNS is stable as each service lands (1.3-b..d);
; nothing may be listening yet on some of these until its own task is done.
; Rendered from island.yaml by island-init render — do not hand-edit.
$ORIGIN island.
$TTL 300
@       IN SOA  ns.island. hostmaster.island. ( 2026091101 3600 600 604800 300 )
@       IN NS   ns.island.
ns      IN A    10.46.0.53
portal  IN A    10.46.0.10
library IN A    10.46.0.11
learn   IN A    10.46.0.11
maps    IN A    10.46.0.11
chat    IN A    10.46.0.20
talk    IN A    10.46.0.30
console IN A    10.46.0.40
